            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is very good. It maybe had a few too many marshmallows, but that didn't keep me from getting a second helping. I also liked putting just a bit of whipped cream on top. DH is allergic to kiwi, so I had to leave that out. Kiwi would have added a nice bit of color to it though.",
            "datePublished": "2015-08-06T08:52:33.600Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "wtl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very yummy! Very easy to make. I didn't have any strawberries or kiwis, but I did add some cool whip and it's delicious! Thank you for this recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-23T11:36:27.530Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not have instant lemon pudding but I did have instant cheesecake pudding. I used that instead. I did add in one more cup of chopped strawberries and two more chopped kiwi. This is a very nice fluffy salad--the kids and I loved it........I can't stop eating it. This is even better if it sits overnight, if you can wait that long to dig into it.",
